1	SIMPLE	t1	NULL	ALL	NULL	NULL	NULL	NULL	5	100.00	Parallel query dop=4
Warnings:
Note	1003	/* select#1 */ select sum(`test`.`t1`.`val`) AS `SUM(val)` from `test`.`t1`
